# --- BB append-only merge drivers | 2026-09-01 ---
# Every agent appends a row at the bottom of these files, so parallel branches
# collide on the same line every time. Those conflicts are mechanical, not
# semantic: union merge keeps BOTH sides instead of stopping the merge.
#
# Measured on BB_Micro_Bridge 2026-09-01: VERSION_MATRIX.md and TEST_LOG.md
# accounted for 65 of the last 200 commit-touches on main.
#
# SESSION_STATE.md is deliberately NOT here — it is rewritten in place
# (+41/-21 on a sample commit), so union merge would duplicate its sections.
**/VERSION_MATRIX.md merge=union
**/TEST_LOG.md       merge=union
**/CHANGELOG.md      merge=union
